@startuml
' Sequence: corporate customer places a recurring lunch order and receives a monthly EHF invoice via Fiken
' Stories: US-16, US-17, US-10, US-11, US-23, US-24, US-25
title Corporate customer places a recurring lunch order and receives a monthly EHF invoice via Fiken
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

actor "henrik : CompanyUser" as U
boundary "web : OrderingUI" as UI
participant "acct : CompanyAccount" as ACC
participant "tpl : Order" as TPL
participant "so : StandingOrder" as SO
participant "day : CapacityDay" as DAY
participant "o : Order" as O
control "inv : InvoicingService" as SVC
participant "invoice : Invoice" as INV
participant "pay : Payment" as PAY
participant "fiken : FikenAPI" as FK <<external>>
actor "Scheduler" as T
actor "Fjordtek finance" as FIN

== Set up the standing order (US-16, US-17) ==
U -> UI : log in on company account
UI -> ACC : verify user belongs to account (role ORDERER/ADMIN)
ACC --> UI : ok
U -> UI : new standing order: Tuesdays, 12 guests,\n3 vegetarian, cost centre "4410"
UI -> TPL ** : create template (OrderLines, GuestGroupDiet 3 x vegetarian,\ncostCentre)
UI -> SO ** : create(weekday = TUE, startDate, leadDays = 7, template = tpl)
UI --> U : standing order saved

== Every week (US-17, US-10) ==
loop for each Tuesday in the period
  T -> SO : generate next occurrence (eventDate - leadDays)
  SO -> DAY : covers available for eventDate? (12)
  alt bookedCovers + 12 <= maxCovers
    SO -> O ** : create copy of tpl (status = CONFIRMED,\nno deposit for company accounts)
    O -> DAY : add 12 covers
    O --> U : confirmation e-mail with order number
  else capacity reached
    SO --> UI : flag occurrence for coordinator review
  end
  opt change before changeDeadline (10:00 day before) (US-11)
    U -> UI : change guests 12 -> 15
    UI -> O : update guestCount, OrderLines
    O -> DAY : add 3 covers
  end
  note over O : kitchen prepares and driver delivers:\nstatus = DELIVERED
end

== Month end: one EHF invoice (US-23, US-24) ==
T -> SVC : run monthly invoicing (month)
SVC -> ACC : monthlyInvoicing? ehfAddress
ACC --> SVC : true, PEPPOL address
SVC -> O : find DELIVERED orders of acct in month
O --> SVC : orders with costCentre / poNumber
SVC -> INV ** : create(kind = EHF, periodStart, periodEnd, totalNok)
SVC -> O : link to invoice, status = INVOICED
SVC -> FK : POST invoice (one line per order,\ncost centre on each line)
alt Fiken accepts
  FK --> SVC : fikenInvoiceId
  SVC -> INV : store fikenInvoiceId
  FK -> FIN : EHF invoice via PEPPOL
else Fiken API error
  FK --> SVC : error
  SVC --> UI : show error on invoice, retry later
end

== Payment (US-25) ==
FIN -> FK : bank transfer
FK -> SVC : payment registered (webhook / poll)
SVC -> PAY ** : create(kind = INVOICE, amountNok, paidAt)
SVC -> INV : paidAt = now (no reminder sent)
@enduml
